---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  eyebrow="Legal"
  description="How WitLabs collects, uses, and protects information shared through this website."
  canonical="https://witlabs.in/privacy-policy/"
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-20">
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <p class="text-body-sm text-muted">Last updated: May 24, 2026</p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-ink">Information we collect</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-muted">
        When you contact WitLabs, we may collect your name, business name, phone number, email address, service interest,
        budget range, and project details. We also receive basic technical information from standard website hosting,
        analytics, and security tools.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-ink">How we use information</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-muted">
        We use submitted information to respond to inquiries, prepare project recommendations, improve our website, and
        maintain basic business records. We do not sell personal information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-ink">Service providers</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-muted">
        We may use trusted third-party tools for form handling, analytics, hosting, email, and communication. These tools
        process information only as needed to provide their services.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-ink">Data retention</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-muted">
        We keep inquiry details for as long as needed to respond, manage client relationships, and meet reasonable
        business or legal requirements.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-ink">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-muted">
        To ask about your information, email <a href="mailto:hello@witlabs.in">hello@witlabs.in</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
